"ännern."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:162
msgid "Page Break"
msgstr "Sietümbrook"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:163
msgid "Force the remainder of the text into the next page"
msgstr "Överbleven Text na de nakamen Siet verdwingen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:164
msgid "All text after this point will be moved into the next page."
msgstr "All Text na disse Steed warrt na de nakamen Siet verschaven"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:166
msgid "Enable Document Headers"
msgstr "Dokment-Koppregen anmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:168
msgid "Disable Document Headers"
msgstr "Dokment-Koppregen utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:169
msgid "Shows and hides header display"
msgstr "Wiest oder verstickt de Koppansicht"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:170
msgid ""
"Selecting this option toggles the display of headers in KWord.<br/><br/"
">Headers are special frames at the top of each page which can contain page "
"numbers or other information."
msgstr ""
"Dit maakt de Koppregen an oder ut.<br/><br/>Koppregen sünd besünner Rahmens "
"baven elk Siet, de Sietnummern oder anner Informatschonen bargen köönt."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:175
msgid "Enable Document Footers"
msgstr "Dokment-Footregen anmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:177
msgid "Disable Document Footers"
msgstr "Dokment-Footregen utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:178
msgid "Shows and hides footer display"
msgstr "Wiest oder verstickt de Footansicht"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:179
msgid ""
"Selecting this option toggles the display of footers in KWord. <br/><br/"
">Footers are special frames at the bottom of each page which can contain "
"page numbers or other information."
msgstr ""
"Dit maakt de Footregen an oder ut.<br/><br/>Footregen sünd besünner Rahmens "
"nerrn elk Siet, de Sietnummern oder anner Informatschonen bargen köönt."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:184
msgid "Snap to Grid"
msgstr "Backig Gadder"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:189
msgid "Raise Frame"
msgstr "Rahmen na vörn"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:192
msgid ""
"Raise the currently selected frame so that it appears above all the other "
"frames"
msgstr "Aktuell köört Rahmen heel na vörn halen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:194
msgid ""
"Raise the currently selected frame so that it appears above all the other "
"frames. This is only useful if frames overlap each other. If multiple frames "
"are selected they are all raised in turn."
msgstr ""
"Aktuell köört Rahmen heel na vörn halen. Dat bringt bloots wat, wenn Rahmens "
"överenanner liggt. Wenn mehr Rahmens köört sünd, warrt se achternanner "
"anornt."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:199
msgid "Lower Frame"
msgstr "Rahmen na achtern"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:202
msgid ""
"Lower the currently selected frame so that it disappears under any frame "
"that overlaps it"
msgstr "Aktuell köört Rahmen heel na achtern stellen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:204
msgid ""
"Lower the currently selected frame so that it disappears under any frame "
"that overlaps it. If multiple frames are selected they are all lowered in "
"turn."
msgstr ""
"Aktuell köört Rahmen heel na achtern stellen. Wenn mehr Rahmens köört sünd, "
"warrt se achternanner anornt."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:208
msgid "Bring to Front"
msgstr "Na vörn halen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:212
msgid "Send to Back"
msgstr "Na achtern stellen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:216
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variable"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:221
msgid "Bookmark..."
msgstr "Leesteken..."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:226
msgid "Select Bookmark..."
msgstr "Leesteken kören..."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:232
msgid "Frame Borders"
msgstr "Rahmenränners"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:233
msgid "Turns the border display on and off"
msgstr "Rahmen an-/utmaken"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:238
msgid ""
"Turns the border display on and off.<br/><br/>The borders are never printed. "
"This option is useful to see how the document will appear on the printed "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Rahmen an-/utmaken<br/><br/>De Ränners warrt nienich druckt. Dit lett sik as "
"Druckvöransicht bruken."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:240
msgid "Page Layout..."
msgstr "Siet-Utsehn..."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:242
msgid "Change properties of entire page"
msgstr "Egenschappen vun de hele Siet ännern"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:243
msgid ""
"Change properties of the entire page.<p>Currently you can change paper size, "
"paper orientation, header and footer sizes, and column settings.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Egenschappen vun de hele Siet ännern.<p>Opstunns kannst Du de Papeergrött, -"
"utrichten, Kopp- un Footreeg-Grötten, un de Striepeninstellen ännern.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:246
msgid "Make inline"
msgstr "Inbetten"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:247
msgid "Convert current frame to an inline frame"
msgstr "Aktuell Rahmen na en inbett Rahmen ümwanneln."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:248
msgid ""
"Convert the current frame to an inline frame.<br><br>Place the inline frame "
"within the text at the point nearest to the frames current position."
msgstr ""
"Aktuell Rahmen na en inbett Rahmen ümwanneln.<br><br>Den inbett Rahmen "
"binnen den Text neegst em sien aktuell Positschoon platzeren."

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:262
msgid "Sentence, word and letter counts for this document"
msgstr "Sätz-, Wöör- un Bookstaventeller för dit Dokment"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:263
msgid ""
"Information on the number of letters, words, syllables and sentences for "
"this document.<p>Evaluates readability using the Flesch reading score.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Informatschonen över de Tall vun Bookstaven, Wöör, Sülven un Sätz binnen dit "
"Dokment.<p>Reekt de Leesborkeit na de \"Flesch-Beweerten\" ut.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:266
msgid "Show Rulers"
msgstr "Linealen wiesen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:268
msgid "Shows or hides rulers"
msgstr "Wiest oder verstickt de Linealen"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:269
msgid ""
"The rulers are the white measuring spaces top and left of the document. The "
"rulers show the position and width of pages and of frames and can be used to "
"position tabulators among others.<p>Uncheck this to disable the rulers from "
"being displayed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"De Linealen sünd de witt Maatafstänn baven un linkerhand dat Dokment. De "
"Linealen wiest de Positschoon un Breed vun Sieden un Rahmens un laat sik "
"för't Positschoneren vun Tabulatoren bruken.<p>Maak dit ut, wenn Du keen "
"Linealen wiesen wullt.</p>"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:277
msgid "Delete Page"
msgstr "Siet wegdoon"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:283
msgid "Formatting Characters"
msgstr "Formateren-Tekens"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:287
msgid "Toggle the display of non-printing characters"
msgstr "Nich-druckbor Tekens wiesen/versteken"

#. +> trunk
#: part/KWView.cpp:288
msgid ""
"Toggle the display of non-printing characters.<br/><br/>When this is "
"enabled, KWord shows you tabs, spaces, carriage returns and other non-"
"printing characters."
msgstr ""
"Nich-druckbor Tekens wiesen/versteken.<br/><br/>Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt "
"Tabulatoren, Freetekens, WagenRetuurs un anner nich-druckbor Tekens wiest."

